l Card or Recovery Card used on an ally this turn grants 1 stack of 【Hold Order】 (max 2, +25% Defense per stack, lasts indefinitely), units with 【Hold Order】 lose all 【Hold Order】 stacks after being hit"}}],"debateSouls":[{"id":"1003201","name":{"zh":"大御策","en":"Grand Stratagem Guard"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"以脑力抵挡35%伤害","en":"Mental Energy blocks 35% of damage"}}],"soulPoints":{"war":6000,"battle":4000,"debate":6800},"equipment":[{"id":"WP12013","name":{"zh":"铁刀","en":"Iron Saber"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"流传最久、随处可见的经典款式。","en":"The most enduring and ubiquitous classic design."},"atkVal":"5","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1008905","name":{"zh":"山纹护心甲·甲","en":"Mountain Heart Guard - I"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"在山纹甲的基础上额外添加了一件铁护心，通常由校尉或伍长穿戴。","en":"Mountain-pattern armor with an added iron heart guard, typically worn by captains or squad leaders."},"defenceVal":"10","price":"6000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1021105","name":{"zh":"陷阵盔·丙","en":"Shock Helm - III"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"据说比常规铁盔多一道稳固工序，并且会用特制盔沿的头盔，多为陷阵冲锋之人佩戴。","en":"A helmet said to undergo an extra reinforcing step and feature a specially crafted brim, mostly worn by those who charge enemy ranks."},"defenceVal":"3","price":"2600","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1010102","name":{"zh":"铁铆盾","en":"Riveted Iron Shield"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"在盾牌表面留有一圈铁铆的盾牌，较为常见。","en":"A shield with a ring of iron rivets on its surface, fairly common."},"price":"2800","slot":{"zh":"盾","en":"Shield"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10397","code":"0"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI100615","name":{"zh":"河内司马氏","en":"The Sima clan of Henei"},"years":["0","420"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，高阳帝重黎之后，程伯休父为周司马，后裔以官为氏，河内郡顶级望族。三国终结者，代魏建晋。司马懿、司马师、司马昭三代谋国，西晋统一天下。两晋共一百五十余年，西晋为刘聪攻灭，东晋为刘裕所篡。","en":"Descended from the Ji surname, posterity of Chongli from the lineage of Emperor Gaoyang. Xiufu, Earl of Cheng, served as Sima of Zhou, and his descendants took the official post as their clan name, becoming a premier prominent clan of Henei Commandery. The terminators of the Three Kingdoms, they supplanted Wei to establish Jin. Across three generations, Sima Yi, Sima Shi, and Sima Zhao plotted to take the state, culminating in the Western Jin unifying all under heaven. The two Jin dynasties spanned over 150 years in total, the Western Jin was crushed and conquered by Liu Cong, while the Eastern Jin was usurped by Liu Yu."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"7","politics":"6"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"16800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"16800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"17050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190