"en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"17050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10005","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,58,83,71,74,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"17050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12013","armor":"WP1008905","helmet":"WP1021105","shield":"WP1010102"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，司马孚之子，晋国宗室。负责守卫长城一带。姜维北伐时携军迎击，并屡次识破姜维使用的阵法，极大的抑制了姜维部队的前进，后用离间计使姜维撤退。西晋建立后，司马望受封义阳王，多次统率中军抵御吴国的进攻，官至大司马。","tc":"魏國武將，司馬孚之子，晉國宗室。負責守衛長城一帶。姜維北伐時攜軍迎擊，并屢次識破姜維使用的陣法，極大的抑制了姜維部隊的前進，后用離間計使姜維撤退。西晉建立后，司馬望受封義陽王，多次統率中軍抵御吳國的進攻，官至大司馬。","en":"An officer of Wei, son of Sima Fu, and a member of the Jin imperial clan. He was responsible for defending the Changcheng region. During Jiang Wei's northern expeditions, he led his forces to intercept them, repeatedly seeing through Jiang Wei's formations, which greatly hindered the advance of Jiang Wei's troops. He later used a stratagem of sowing discord to compel Jiang Wei's retreat. After the founding of Western Jin, Sima Wang was enfeoffed as Prince of Yiyang. He commanded the central army on multiple occasions to repel Eastern Wu's offensives, eventually rising to the rank of Grand Minister.","jp":"魏の武将。司馬孚の子で、晋の宗室。長城一帯の防衛を担った。姜維の北伐の際には軍を率いて迎え撃ち、姜維が用いる陣形を幾度も見破ってその進軍を大いに阻み、後に離間の計を用いて姜維を撤退させた。西晋の建国後は義陽王に封じられ、度々中軍を統率して呉の侵攻を防ぎ、官位は大司馬に至った。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 사마부의 아들이며, 진나라의 종실입니다. 장성 일대의 수비를 맡았습니다. 강유가 북벌을 감행했을 때 군사를 이끌고 가 요격하였으며, 강유가 펼친 진법을 누차 간파하여 강유군의 진격을 크게 저지했습니다. 이후 이간계를 써서 강유를 퇴각시켰습니다. 서진 건국 후에는 의양왕에 봉해졌고, 여러 차례 중군을 통솔하여 오나라의 침공을 막아냈으며 관직은 대사마에 이르렀습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10673","remark":"","surname":"司马","surnameTc":"司馬","surnameEn":"Sima","surnameJp":"司馬","surnameKr":"사마","surnameOther":"","name":"望","nameTc":"望","nameEn":"Wang","nameJp":"望","nameKr":"망","nameOther":"","word":"子初","wordTc":"子初","wordEn":"Zichu","wordJp":"子初","wordKr":"자초","wordOther":"","icon":"司马望","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"219","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"58","wise":"83","politics":"71","charm":"74","will":"53","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"11","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"50/50/50/51/50/50/50/50","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1020802","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1003302;1005105","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1020705","debateSoul":"1003201","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"4000","debateSoulPoint":"6800","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"2/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/2/1/0/0/0/1/0/4/2/2/2/2/1/1/0/3","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"16